  "title": "· New Bags | Louis Vuitton's Iconic Silhouette Gets a Refresh: The Alma Soft ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Louis Vuitton 经典手袋焕新登场：Alma Soft 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton refreshes its Fall/Winter 2026 handbags, softening the Alma and OnTheGo and adding a detachable strap to the Pochette Métis.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-03",
  "date_label": "November 03, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/6ge4rqw/bee78e91c47e6cf6.jpg",
  "tags": [
