    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Alma Soft ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Alma Soft MM carries on the architectural shell shape, but its standout feature is a body crafted in softer Monogram canvas with a fabric lining, paired with a detachable tubular short strap; gentle folds at the base give the bag a laid-back feel. Three designs debut this season: one trimmed in classic VVN leather with a name tag printed with the brand's headquarters facade and a metal trunk charm, lined in the diamond quilting of the archive trunks; one with deep navy waxed-leather trim, a red-striped lining and a charm shaped like the LV Ombres eyeshadow palette, drawn from the brand's beauty line; and one with burgundy ostrich-leather trim enlivened by colorful beading. Roomy enough for a tablet and daily essentials, it's made for weekends in the city or further afield.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
