    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· OnTheGo Soft ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The OnTheGo Soft reshapes the clean-lined tote in a supple structure, offered in classic Monogram canvas and Monogram Empreinte embossed leather. The small size features tubular double handles and a detachable long strap, while the medium comes with both short and long handles so it can be carried by hand or on the shoulder; the generous interior easily holds a laptop, making it ideal for commutes and weekend trips.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
