      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Steamer MM takes its design cues from the soft-sided Steamer travel bag of 1900, originally conceived as a laundry bag for clothes changed during a journey. This season brings two designs, a shoulder bag and a handbag, both in Monogram canvas with VVN leather trim, a short flap and a metal padlock for a vintage, timeless feel.",
